  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Market Study into the Praziquantel drug that is used for the Integrated Control of Schistosomiasis and Intestinal Helminths in Sub-Saharan Africa is a component of Integrated Control of Schistosomiasis and Intestinal Helminths in Sub-Saharan Africa (ICOSA) - Phase 1 &amp; 2 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;31,684. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control.</narrative>
  </description>
